hadiths[91]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1285","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya ke kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah aur uskey Rasool par imaan lana. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein jihad karna. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Hajje mabroor. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1286","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa amal Allah Taala ko zyada mehboob hai? Aap ne farmaya: Namaz apne waqt par. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Walidain key sath husn-e-sulook. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein jihad. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1287","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par imaan lana aur uskey rastey mein jihad karna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1288","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein subah ya shaam chalna duniya aur jo kuchh us mein hai us se behtar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1289","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Logon mein kaun afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo momin jo apni jaan aur maal key sath Allah key rastey mein jihad karta hai. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Wo momin jo ghaatiyon mein se kisi ghaati mein Allah ki ibaadat karta hai aur logon ko apne shar se bachaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1290","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein aik din sarhad ki hifaazat duniya aur jo kuchh us par hai us se behtar hai, aur Jannat mein tum mein se kisi key kodey ki jagah duniya aur jo kuchh us par hai us se behtar hai, aur banda jo shaam Allah Taala key rastey mein chalta hai ya subah, wo duniya aur jo kuchh us par hai us se behtar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1291","Salmaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aik din aur raat sarhad ki hifaazat aik maah key rozey aur qayaam se behtar hai, aur agar wo us mein mar jaey to uska amal jo wo karta tha us par jaari kya jaeyga, aur us par uska rizq jaari kya jaeyga, aur wo aazmaane waley se aman mein raheyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1292","Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har mayyit key amal par mohar laga di jaati hai siwaey Allah key rastey mein sarhad ki hifaazat karne waley key, kyonke uskey liye uska amal qayamat key din tak badhaya jaata hai, aur wo qabr key fitney se aman mein raheyga. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1293","Usman (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah key rastey mein aik din sarhad ki hifaazat hazaar din se behtar hai jo doosri manzilon mein hon. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1294","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne uskey liye zamaant li hai jo uskey rastey mein nikley, usey sirf merey rastey mein jihad aur mujh par imaan aur merey Rasoolon ki tasdeeq ne nikaala hai, to wo merey zimma hai ke main usey Jannat mein dakhil karun, ya usey uskey ghar ki taraf wapas karun jis se wo nikla tha us ajr ya maal-e-ghanimat key sath jo us ne paaya. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Jo zakhm Allah key rastey mein lagey wo qayamat key din aisa aayega jaisa us din tha jab laga tha, uska rang khoon ka rang hoga aur uski khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Agar Musalmanon par mushkil na guzarti to main kabhi kisi lashkar key peechey na baith-ta jo Allah key rastey mein ghazwa karta hai, lekin main kushadgi nahi paata ke unhey sawaar karun aur wo kushadgi nahi paatey ke mujh se peechey rahein. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Main chaahta hun ke Allah key rastey mein ghazwa karun aur qatl kya jaun, phir ghazwa karun aur qatl kya jaun, phir ghazwa karun aur qatl kya jaun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne baaz hissa riwayat kya hai. Kalm zakhm hai."
"1295","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zakhmi Allah key rastey mein zakhmi ho wo qayamat key din aayega jabke uska zakhm beh raha hoga, rang khoon ka rang hoga aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1296","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman aadmi Allah key rastey mein oontni key dohan key waqfey key barabar qitaal karey to uskey liye Jannat waajib ho gai, aur jo Allah key rastey mein zakhmi ho ya thokar lagey to wo qayamat key din aayegi jaisi sab se zyada thi: Uska rang zaafraan ka hoga aur uski khushbu mushk ki tarah hogi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1297","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se aik aadmi aik ghaati par guzra jis mein meethay paani ka chashma tha to usey achchha laga. To us ne kaha: Kaash main logon se alag hokar is ghaati mein theher jaun, lekin main aisa nahi karunga yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat lun. To us ne uska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo kyonke tum mein se kisi ka Allah key rastey mein theherna apne ghar mein sattar saal namaz padhney se behtar hai. Kya tum nahi chaahtey ke Allah tumhey bakhsh dey aur tumhey Jannat mein dakhil karey? Allah key rastey mein ghazwa karo. Jo Allah key rastey mein oontni key dohan key waqfey key barabar qitaal karey to uskey liye Jannat waajib ho gai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur fawaaq do dohan key darmiyaan hai."
"1298","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah key rastey mein jihad key barabar kaun sa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum uski taqat nahi rakhtey. To unhon-ne Aap par do ya teen martaba dohraaya, har martaba Aap farmatey: Tum uski taqat nahi rakhtey! Phir farmaya: Allah key rastey mein jihad karne waley ki misaal us rozedaar namaz guzaar farmanbardaar ki si hai jo Allah ki aayaat key sath namaz aur rozey se nahi thakta yahan tak ke Allah key rastey mein jihad karne wala wapas aey. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai). Aur Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise amal ki rahnumai karein jo jihad key barabar ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main nahi paata. Phir farmaya: Kya tum taqat rakhtey ho ke jab mujaahid nikley to tum apni masjid mein dakhil ho aur khadey raho aur na thako, aur rozey rakho aur iftaar na karo? To us ne kaha: Aur iski taqat kaun rakh sakta hai?!"
"1299","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ki behtreen guzraan walon mein se aik aadmi hai jo Allah key rastey mein apne ghodey ki lagaam pakdey huey hai, wo uski peeth par udta hai jab kabhi pukaar ya ghabrahat suney to uski peeth par udta hai, wo qatl ya maut ko uski jagah mein talaash karta hai, ya aik aadmi bakriyon mein ya in chotiyon mein se kisi choti mein ya in waadiyon mein se kisi waadi key pait mein namaz qaim karta hai aur zakaat deta hai, aur apne Rab ki ibaadat karta hai yahan tak ke usey maut aa jaey, wo logon mein sirf bhalai mein hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1300","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein sau darjaat hain jo Allah ne Allah key rastey mein jihad karne walon key liye taiyaar kiye hain, do darjaat key darmiyaan aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan jaisa faasla hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1301","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key Rab honay par aur Islam key deen honay par aur Muhammad key Rasool honay par raazi ho to uskey liye Jannat waajib ho gai. To Abu Saeed ne us par taajjub kya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Usey mujh par dohraein. To Aap ne us par dohraaya, phir farmaya: Aur doosri chiz jiskey sath Allah bandey ko Jannat mein sau darjaat buland farmata hai, har do darjaat key darmiyaan aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan jaisa faasla hai. Us ne kaha: Aur wo kya hai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein jihad, Allah key rastey mein jihad. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1302","Abu Bakr bin Abi Musa Ashari se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne walid (Raziallahu anhu) se suna jabke wo dushman key saamney they, wo kehtey they: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat key darwaazey talwaaron key saayon key neechey hain. To buri haalat wala aik aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ae Abu Musa! Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To wo apne saathiyon ki taraf wapas aaya aur kaha: Tum par salaam padhta hun. Phir us ne apni talwaar ka khol toda aur phenka, phir apni talwaar key sath dushman ki taraf chala aur us se maara yahan tak ke qatl ho gaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1303","Abu Abs Abdur Rahman bin Jabr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis bandey key donon qadam Allah key rastey mein ghubaar aalood hon to usey dozakh nahi chhueygi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1304","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh mein wo aadmi dakhil nahi hoga jo Allah key khauf se roya yahan tak ke doodh than mein wapas aa jaey, aur bandey par Allah key rastey ka ghubaar aur dozakh ka dhuaan jama nahi hongey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1305","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Do aankhein hain jinhey dozakh nahi chhueygi: Aik aankh jo Allah key khauf se roi, aur aik aankh jo Allah key rastey mein pehra deti raat guzaarey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1306","Zaid bin Khaalid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key rastey mein ghazwa karne waley ko taiyaar karey to us ne ghazwa kya, aur jo ghazwa karne waley key peechey uskey ghar walon mein bhalai key sath khalifa bano to us ne ghazwa kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1307","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afzal sadqaat Allah key rastey mein kheemey ka saaya hai, aur Allah key rastey mein khaadim ka doodh dena hai, aur Allah key rastey mein sawaar honay wali oontni hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1308","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aslam ka aik ladka aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ghazwa ka irada rakhta hun aur merey paas wo nahi hai jis se main taiyaari karun. Aap ne farmaya: Fulaan key paas jao, wo taiyaar hua tha phir beemar ho gaya. To wo uskey paas aaya aur us se kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey salaam kehtey hain aur farmatey hain: Mujhey wo dey do jo tum ne taiyaar kya tha. Us ne kaha: Ae fulaani! Usey dey do jo main ne taiyaar kya tha aur us mein se kuchh na rokna, Allah ki qasam! Us mein se kuchh na rokna taake tumharey liye us mein barkat ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1309","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani Lahyaan ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Har do aadmiyon mein se aik nikley, aur ajr un donon key darmiyaan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1310","Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas lohey mein dhampa hua aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main qitaal karun ya Musalman hun? Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ho, phir qitaal kar. To wo Musalman hua, phir qitaal kya aur qatl ho gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne thoda amal kya aur bahut ajr paaya. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"1311","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jannat mein dakhil hota hai wo duniya ki taraf wapas aana pasand nahi karta chaahey uskey liye zameen par jo kuchh hai sab ho, siwaey shaheed key, wo tamanna karta hai ke duniya ki taraf wapas aey aur das martaba qatl kya jaey us izzat ki wjah se jo wo dekhta hai."
"1312","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah shaheed key liye har chiz bakhsh dega siwaey qarz key. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1313","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un mein khadey huey aur zikr kya ke Allah key rastey mein jihad aur Allah par imaan afzal aamaal hain. To aik aadmi khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataein agar main Allah key rastey mein qatl kya jaun to kya meri khataein mita di jaengi? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan agar tum Allah key rastey mein qatl kiye jao jabke tum sabr karne waley sawaab ki ummeed rakhne waley aagey badhney waley peeth na pherne waley ho. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne kaisey kaha? Us ne kaha: Bataein agar main Allah key rastey mein qatl kya jaun to kya meri khataein mita di jaengi? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan jabke tum sabr karne waley sawaab ki ummeed rakhne waley aagey badhney waley peeth na pherne waley ho, siwaey qarz key, kyonke Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) ne mujh se ye kaha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1314","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Main kahaan hun ya Rasulullah agar main qatl kya jaun? Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein. To us ne khajoorein phenk dein jo uskey haath mein thein, phir qitaal kya yahan tak ke qatl ho gaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1315","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba rawana huey yahan tak ke wo mushrikon se pehley Badr pahunch gaey, aur mushrik aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi chiz ki taraf aagey na badhey yahan tak ke main us se pehley hun. To mushrik qareeb aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Utho us Jannat ki taraf jiski chaudai aasmaan aur zameen hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Umair bin Al-Hamaam Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain: Ya Rasulullah! Jannat jiski chaudai aasmaan aur zameen hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Wah wah! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhey tumharey wah wah kehney par kis ne ubhara? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah! Sirf us ummeed par ke main un mein se hun. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tum un mein se ho. To us ne apne tarqash mein se khajoorein nikaalein aur un mein se khaaney laga. Phir kaha: Agar main zinda raha yahan tak ke apni ye khajoorein khaun to ye lambi zindagi hai! To us ne jo khajoorein uskey paas thein phenk dein, phir un se qitaal kya yahan tak ke qatl ho gaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1316","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey ke hamarey sath aadmi bhejein jo hamein Quran aur Sunnat sikhaein. To Aap ne unki taraf Ansaar mein se sattar aadmi bheje jinhey Qurra kaha jata hai, un mein merey maamun Haraam they. Wo raat mein Quran padhtey aur uska daur kartey they aur seekhtey they, aur din mein paani laatey aur usey masjid mein rakhtey, aur lakdiyan kaat-tey aur unhey baichtey aur us se Ahle Suffa aur fuqara key liye khaana khareedtey. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey bheja to wo un par toot padey aur unhey jagah pahunchney se pehley qatl kar diya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Hamarey Nabi ko hamari taraf se pahunchadey ke ham Tujh se miley aur ham Tujh se raazi huey aur Tu ham se raazi hua. Aur aik aadmi Anas key maamun Haraam key peechey se aaya aur usey naiza maara yahan tak ke paar kar diya. To Haraam ne kaha: Kaaba key Rab ki qasam kamyaab hua! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumharey bhai qatl kiye gaey hain aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Hamarey Nabi ko hamari taraf se pahunchadey ke ham Tujh se miley aur ham Tujh se raazi huey aur Tu ham se raazi hua. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai)."
"1317","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey chacha Anas bin An-Nazr (Raziallahu anhu) Ghazwa Badr se ghaaib rahey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main pehley qitaal se ghaaib raha jis mein tum ne mushrikon se qitaal kya. Agar Allah mujhey mushrikon key qitaal mein haazir karey to Allah dekhega ke main kya karta hun. Phir jab Uhad ka din hua aur Musalman muntashir ho gaey to unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri taraf uzr karta hun us se jo inhon-ne kya, yaani sahaaba, aur Teri taraf baraat karta hun us se jo inhon-ne kya, yaani mushrik. Phir aagey badhey to Saad bin Muaz unhey miley. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Saad bin Muaz! Jannat, An-Nazr key Rab ki qasam! Beshak main uski khushbu Uhad se pehley paata hun! Saad ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main taqat na rakh saka jo us ne kya! Anas ne kaha: To ham ne us mein assi se kuchh oopar talwaar ki maar, ya naizey ki chot, ya teer ki maar paai, aur ham ne usey qatl hua paaya aur mushrikon ne uska musla kar diya tha. To usey uski behan key siwa koi na pehchaan saka ungli key poron se. Anas ne kaha: Ham dekhtey they, ya gumaan kartey they ke ye aayat unkey aur un jaison key baarey mein naazil hui: Mominon mein se aise mard hain jinhon-ne Allah se kiye huey ahd ko sach kar dikhaya, to un mein se koi apni nazr poori kar chuka, aakhir tak (Al-Ahzaab 23). (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Mujaahida key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"1318","Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne aaj raat do aadmi dekhey jo merey paas aey aur mujhey darakht par chadhaya aur mujhey aik ghar mein dakhil kya jo sab se achchha aur afzal hai, main ne kabhi us se achchha nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Raha ye ghar to shuhada ka ghar hai."
"1319","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umm Ar-Rabee bint Al-Bara jo Haaritha bin Suraaqa ki walida hain, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey Haaritha key baarey mein na bataogey? Aur wo Badr key din qatl ho gaey they. Phir agar wo Jannat mein hain to main sabr karungi, aur agar uskey siwa kuchh hai to main us par ronay mein koshish karungi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umm Haaritha! Beshak wo Jannat mein jannatein hain, aur beshak tumharey betey ne Firdaus-e-Aala paai hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1320","Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey walid ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaya gaya jabke unka musla kar diya gaya tha. To wo Aap key saamney rakh diye gaey. To main unkey chehrey se kapda hataaney gaya to qaum ne mujhey mana kya. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishtey unhey apne paron se saaya kiye huey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1321","Sehel bin Hunaif (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah Taala se sachchai key sath shahaadat maangey to Allah usey shuhada key manaazil tak pahunchayega chaahey wo apne bistar par mar jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1322","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sachchai key sath shahaadat talab karey to usey di jaegi chaahey usey na pahunchy. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1323","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaheed qatl ki takleef nahi paata siwaey iskey jaisa tum mein se koi chutki ki takleef paata hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1324","Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz dinon mein jin mein Aap dushman se miley, suraj dhalney tak intizaar farmatey, phir logon mein khadey hotey aur farmatey: Ae logon! Dushman se milney ki tamanna na karo, aur Allah se aafiyat maango. Phir jab un se milo to sabr karo, aur jaan lo ke Jannat talwaaron key saayon key neechey hai. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Kitaab naazil karne waley aur baadal chalaaney waley aur girohon ko shikast dene waley! Unhey shikast dey aur un par hamari madad farma. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1325","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do duaen radd nahi hotin, ya kam radd hotin: Azaan key waqt dua, aur ladai key waqt jab baaz baaz se miltey hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1326","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ghazwa farmatey to kehtey: Ae Allah! Tu mera baazu hai aur mera madadgaar hai. Terey sath main palat-ta hun aur Terey sath ghoomta hun aur Terey sath hamla karta hun, aur Terey sath qitaal karta hun. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1327","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi qaum se dartey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Beshak ham Tujhey unkey seenon mein kartey hain aur ham Teri panah maangtey hain unkey shuroor se. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1328","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaniyon mein qayamat key din tak bhalai bandhi hui hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1329","Urwa Baariqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaniyon mein qayamat key din tak bhalai bandhi hui hai: Ajr aur maal-e-ghanimat. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1330","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key rastey mein ghoda baandhey Allah par imaan aur uskey waadey ki tasdeeq key sath, to uska pait bharna aur uski leed aur uska peshaab qayamat key din uskey meezaan mein hongey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1331","Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas lagaam di hui oontni lekar aaya aur us ne kaha: Ye Allah key rastey mein hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey liye uskey sabab qayamat key din saat sau oontniyan hongi sab lagaam di hui. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1332","Abu Hammaad, aur kaha gaya Abu Saad, aur kaha gaya Abu Asad, aur kaha gaya Abu Aamir, aur kaha gaya Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Al-Aswad, aur kaha gaya Abu Abs, Uqba bin Aamir Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmatey huey suna: Aur unkey liye jitni taqat ho sakey taiyaari karo, khabardaar! Beshak quwwat teer andaazi hai, khabardaar! Beshak quwwat teer andaazi hai, khabardaar! Beshak quwwat teer andaazi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Anqareeb tum par zameenein fatah hongi aur Allah tumhey kaafi hoga, isliye tum mein se koi apne teeron key sath khelne se aajiz na ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1333","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Anqareeb tum par zameenein fatah hongi aur Allah tumhey kaafi hoga, isliye tum mein se koi apne teeron key sath khelne se aajiz na ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1334","Unhin se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne teer andaazi seekhi phir usey chhora to wo ham mein se nahi, ya us ne nafarmaani ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1335","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah aik teer key sabab teen aadmiyon ko Jannat mein dakhil farmata hai: Banaane wala jo apne banaane mein bhalai ki ummeed rakhta hai, aur phenkney wala, aur dene wala. Aur teer phenko aur sawaari karo, aur tumhara teer phenkna mujhey tumharey sawaar honay se zyada mehboob hai. Aur jo teer andaazi seekhney key baad us se beraghbati key sabab chhor dey to wo naimat hai jisey us ne chhora, ya farmaya: Uska kufr kya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1336","Salma bin Al-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) teer andaazi karne waley giroh par guzrey aur farmaya: Teer phenko ae Bani Ismaeel! Kyonke tumharey waalid teer andaaz they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1337","Amr bin Abasa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Allah key rastey mein teer phenkey to wo uskey liye aazaad gardan key barabar hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1338","Abu Yahya Khuraim bin Faatik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key rastey mein kharch karey to uskey liye saat sau guna likha jaata hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1339","Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo banda Allah key rastey mein aik din roza rakhey to Allah us din key sabab uskey chehrey ko dozakh se sattar saal door kar dega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1340","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key rastey mein aik din roza rakhey to Allah uskey aur dozakh key darmiyaan aasmaan aur zameen key darmiyaan jaisi khandaq bana dega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1341","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jaey aur us ne ghazwa na kya ho aur na apne dil mein ghazwey ki baat ki ho to wo nifaaq ki aik shaakh par mara. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1342","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwey mein they to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein kuchh aadmi hain, tum ne koi safar na kya aur na koi waadi tey ki magar wo tumharey sath they, unhey beemari ne rok diya."
"1343","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehaati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aadmi maal-e-ghanimat key liye qitaal karta hai, aur aadmi zikr key liye qitaal karta hai, aur aadmi apni jagah dikhaaney key liye qitaal karta hai? Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Bahaduri key liye qitaal karta hai, aur qaum key liye qitaal karta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur ghussey key liye qitaal karta hai. To kaun Allah key rastey mein hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo isliye qitaal karey taake Allah ka kalima buland ho to wo Allah key rastey mein hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1344","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lashkar ya chhota lashkar ghazwa karey aur maal-e-ghanimat paey aur salaamat rahey to wo apne ajron key do tihaai jaldi paa chukey, aur jo lashkar ya chhota lashkar naakaam ho aur museebat mein mubtala ho to unkey ajr poorey hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1345","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey siyaahat ki ijazat dein. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat ki siyaahat Allah Azza wa Jall key rastey mein jihad hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1346","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wapsi ghazwey ki tarah hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1347","Saaib bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ghazwa Tabook se tashreef laey to logon ne Aap ka istiqbaal kya. To main bachchon key sath Saniyatul Wada par Aap se mila. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se isi lafz key sath riwayat kya hai. Aur Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham bachchon key sath Saniyatul Wada tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key istiqbaal key liye gaey."
"1348","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghazwa na karey ya ghazwa karne waley ko taiyaar na karey, ya ghazwa karne waley key peechey uskey ghar walon mein bhalai key sath khalifa na bano to Allah usey qayamat key din se pehley aafat mein mubtala farmayega. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1349","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mushrikon se apne maalon aur apni jaanon aur apni zabaanon key sath jihad karo. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1350","Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Hakeem, Noman bin Muqarrin (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas haazir tha ke jab Aap din key shuru mein qitaal na kartey to qitaal ko muakhkhar farmatey yahan tak ke suraj dhal jaata aur hawa chalti aur madad utarti. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1351","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dushman se milney ki tamanna na karo, phir jab un se milo to sabr karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1352","Unhin se aur Jabir (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ladai dhoka hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1353","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaheed paanch hain: Taoon mein marne wala aur pait mein marne wala, aur doobne wala, aur malbey key neechey dabney wala, aur Allah key rastey mein shaheed. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1354","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne darmiyaan shuhada kisko shumaar kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Jo Allah key rastey mein qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tab to meri ummat key shaheed bahut kam hain! Unhon-ne kaha: To kaun ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah key rastey mein qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo Allah key rastey mein mar jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo taoon mein mar jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo pait mein mar jaey wo shaheed hai, aur doobne wala shaheed hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1355","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal key liye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1356","Abul Aawar Saeed bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail jo Jannat ki bashaarat paaney waley das mein se hain (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne maal key liye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo apne khoon key liye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo apne deen key liye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, aur jo apni izzat key liye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1357","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataein agar koi aadmi aey jo mera maal lena chaahey? Aap ne farmaya: To usey apna maal na do. Us ne kaha: Bataein agar wo mujh se qitaal karey? Aap ne farmaya: Us se qitaal karo. Us ne kaha: Bataein agar wo mujhey qatl kar dey? Aap ne farmaya: To tum shaheed ho. Us ne kaha: Bataein agar main usey qatl kar dun? Aap ne farmaya: Wo dozakh mein hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1358","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jo Musalman gardan aazaad karey to Allah uskey har jorr key badley uska har jorr dozakh se aazaad farmayega yahan tak ke uski sharmgaah key badley uski sharmgaah. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1359","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par imaan lana aur uskey rastey mein jihad karna. Main ne kaha: Kaun si gardan afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne walon key nazdeek nafees ho aur jiski qeemat zyada ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1360","Maaroor bin Suwaid se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha jabke un par joda tha aur unkey ghulaam par waisa hi tha. To main ne un se uskey baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne zikr kya ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein aik aadmi ko gaali di aur usey uski maa key sabab aar dilai. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum aise aadmi ho jis mein jaahiliyat hai. Wo tumharey bhai hain aur tumharey khaadim hain jinhey Allah ne tumharey haathon key neechey kya hai. Phir jiskey bhai uskey haath key neechey ho to usey us mein se khilaey jo wo khaata hai, aur usey us mein se pehnaey jo wo pehenta hai, aur unhey uski takleef na do jo un par ghaalib aey. Phir agar tum unhey takleef do to unki madad karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1361","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka khaadim uska khaana laey to agar wo usey apne sath na bithaey to usey aik ya do luqmey ya aik ya do baar dey, kyonke us ne uski taiyaari ki hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1362","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ghulaam jab apne aaqa ki khairkhwahi karey aur Allah ki ibaadat achchhi tarah karey to uskey liye do guna ajr hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1363","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki karne waley mamluk ghulaam key liye do ajr hain. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Abu Hurairah ki jaan hai! Agar Allah key rastey mein jihad aur Hajj aur meri walida key sath husn-e-sulook na hota to main pasand karta ke main mamluk hokar marun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1364","Abu Musa Ashari se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mamluk jo apne Rab ki ibaadat achchhi tarah karta hai aur apne aaqa ka jo us par haq hai ada karta hai, aur khairkhwahi aur itaat karta hai, uskey liye do ajr hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1365","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen key liye do ajr hain: Ahle Kitaab mein se aik aadmi jo apne Nabi par imaan laya aur Muhammad par imaan laya, aur mamluk ghulaam jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaon ka haq ada karey, aur aik aadmi jiski londi thi aur us ne usey adab sikhaya aur achchha adab sikhaya, aur usey taleem di aur achchhi taleem di, phir usey aazaad kya aur us se shaadi ki, to uskey liye do ajr hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1366","Maaqil bin Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitney key waqt ibaadat meri taraf hijrat ki tarah hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1367","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jo Aap se taqaza karta tha aur us ne Aap key sath sakhti ki. To Aap key sahaaba ne uska irada kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey chhor do kyonke haq waley key liye baat hai. Phir farmaya: Usey uskey daant jaisa daant do. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham uskey daant se behtar key siwa nahi paatey. Aap ne farmaya: Usey do kyonke tum mein sab se behtar wo hai jo ada karne mein sab se achchha hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1368","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem farmaye jo baichtey waqt aur khareedtey waqt aur taqaza kartey waqt narm hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1369","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo chahta hai ke Allah usey qayamat key din ki museebat se nijaat dey to wo tangdast ko mohlat dey ya us se kami karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1370","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi logon ko qarz deta tha aur wo apne ladkey se kehta tha: Jab tum tangdast key paas aao to us se darguzar karo, shayed Allah ham se darguzar karey. To wo Allah se mila aur Allah ne us se darguzar kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1371","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehley aik aadmi ka hisaab liya gaya aur uskey liye bhalai mein se kuchh na paaya gaya siwaey iskey ke wo logon se milta tha, aur wo maaldaar tha, aur wo apne ladkon ko hukm deta tha ke tangdast se darguzar karein. Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Ham iskey is se zyada haqdaar hain, us se darguzar karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1372","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah Taala apne bandon mein se aik bandey ko laaya jisey Allah ne maal diya tha. To us se farmaya: Tum ne duniya mein kya amal kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo Allah se baat nahi chhupaatey. Us ne kaha: Ae Rab! Tune mujhey apna maal diya tha aur main logon se khareed o farokht karta tha, aur meri aadat darguzar thi. To main maaldaar par aasaani karta tha aur tangdast ko mohlat deta tha. To Allah Taala ne farmaya: Main tum se iska zyada haqdaar hun, merey bandey se darguzar karo. To Uqba bin Aamir aur Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Ham ne isey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key munh se is tarah suna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1373","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat dey ya uskey liye kami karey to Allah usey qayamat key din apne arsh key saaye key neechey saaya dega jis din uskey saaye key siwa koi saaya nahi hoga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1374","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se oont khareeda aur usey taula aur zyada diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1375","Abu Safwaan Suwaid bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne aur Makhrama Abdi ne Hajar se kapda laaya. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashreef laey aur ham se paajaama ka bhao lagaya. Aur merey paas taulney wala tha jo ujrat par taulta tha. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taulney waley se farmaya: Taul aur zyada dey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
